 "notes": "Teddy bear split from Plush toy as its own kind; old Steiff models became versions of the Steiff jointed bear archetype. Pop Mart vinyl-face plush ranges (Labubu/THE MONSTERS, MOLLY etc.) and Kidrobot Labbit left out here for the Designer toy shelf (vinyl-face figures, not plush). Puppet keeps old s; added glove, rod, marionette, shadow types and four tradition archetypes. Hermann, Build-A-Bear, Vermont Teddy Bear and Folkmanis not given archetypes (no models confirmed); Jellycat Bashful Bunny year only 'early 2000s'."
}